SET source_provenance = COALESCE(source_provenance, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"student_orientation":{"whatItStudies":"Software engineering is the discipline of designing, building and testing computer programs and mobile applications. Practitioners write and debug code, analyse what a program should do, test software at different levels, and manage changes to systems, in roles such as software analyst, tester, mobile application developer and cloud engineer. They typically work in technology firms, banks, telecoms companies and government agencies.","whatPeopleDo":"Practitioners write and debug code, analyse what a program should do, test software at different levels, and manage changes to systems, in roles such as software analyst, tester, mobile application developer and cloud engineer. They typically work in technology firms, banks, telecoms companies and government agencies.","questions":["What does Software Engineering help people understand, create or solve?","What evidence, methods or outputs are used in Software Engineering?","Where is Software Engineering applied, and what further preparation can a chosen area require?"],"whereProgrammeFits":"Programmes connect to Software Engineering only where their recorded curriculum supports the mapped relationship.","relatedProgrammes":["Business Information Technology","Project Management","Information Technology and Health Informatics","Computer Science","Cybersecurity","Data Science","Information and Communication Technology","Information Systems"]},"guidance_contract":"global_domain_foundation_v1"}'::jsonb
