    ('D003', 'start_here', 'Understand Artificial Intelligence', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Artificial intelligence covers building computer systems that learn from data to recognise images, understand language and make predictions. Machine learning engineers, data scientists and researchers write computer programs, apply statistics, run computer simulations and train models, then present their results visually. Typical workplaces include technology companies, research institutes, banks and universities.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D003", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
