    ('D147', 'start_here', 'Understand Process Automation, SCADA, PLC', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Process automation keeps factories and plants running through computer-controlled systems. Control room operators monitor automated machines in refineries, gas plants and production lines, troubleshoot faults and write reports, while automation and instrumentation engineers design the control systems themselves. Manufacturing companies and oil and gas facilities employ most of these professionals.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D147", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
