    ('D164', 'start_here', 'Understand Urban Mobility, Smart City Systems', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Urban mobility and smart city planning organise how people and transport move around cities. Transport planners and engineers design road, rail and airport projects, while land planners and smart city consultants apply urban planning and environmental policy to make cities work better. Government agencies, engineering firms and construction companies carry out this work.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D164", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
