    ('D025', 'start_here', 'Understand Pharmacy', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Pharmacy is the science and practice of preparing and dispensing medicines. Pharmacists dispense drugs in hospitals and community pharmacies, industrial pharmacists and quality specialists oversee safe manufacturing, and technicians and assistants support dispensing, clinical trials and daily operations. The training draws on chemistry, physics and microbiology, and pharmacists in Nigeria must be licensed by the Pharmacists Council.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D025", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
