    ('D067', 'start_here', 'Understand Dentistry', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Dentistry is the branch of medicine concerned with teeth, gums and the mouth. Dentists examine patients and diagnose oral health problems, dental technicians make models and appliances, hygienists and chairside assistants support treatment, and maxillofacial surgeons operate on the mouth and jaw. Most work in hospitals, dental clinics and laboratories, and practising in Nigeria requires registration with the Medical and Dental Council.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D067", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
