    ('D154', 'start_here', 'Understand Exercise Science, Sports Therapy', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Exercise science and sports therapy focus on how the body moves, performs and recovers. Physiotherapists and sport therapists treat injuries, kinesiologists assess physical condition, dietitians advise on nutrition, and instructors coach fitness and pilates. Hospitals, clinics, sports clubs and fitness centres employ most people in the field.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D154", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
