    ('D165', 'start_here', 'Understand Wellness Coaching, Lifestyle Medicine', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Wellness coaching and lifestyle medicine help people stay healthy through everyday habits. Dietitians and nutritionists advise on food, fitness instructors and pilates teachers lead exercise, and music and dance therapists use creative activities to support healing. Clinics, gyms, wellness centres and private practice are typical settings.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D165", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
