    ('D028', 'start_here', 'Understand General Management', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: General management is the running of organisations and their departments. Managers direct budgets, finance, quality and facilities, consultants advise on strategy and business improvements, and senior executives and entrepreneurs lead whole organisations. Because every sector needs this work, managers are found in banks, factories, retailers, government agencies and non-profit organisations alike.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D028", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
