    ('D030', 'start_here', 'Understand Marketing, Brand', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Marketing builds brands and persuades customers to choose a product or service. Creatives and analysts research markets, run campaigns, manage online communities and sales channels, and shape how an organisation presents itself, while senior leaders steer overall marketing, sales and communication strategy. Marketing departments, advertising agencies and media houses are common workplaces.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D030", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
