    ('D031', 'start_here', 'Understand Sales', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Sales is the business of getting goods and services to buyers. Some practitioners purchase, broker and trade goods and commodities, others sell machinery, energy and technical products to businesses, manage key customer accounts, or serve shoppers on the shop floor, while directors set commercial strategy. Retailers, wholesalers, manufacturers and trading companies employ them.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D031", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
