    ('D032', 'start_here', 'Understand Project Management', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Project management is the planning and coordination of work so it finishes on time and within budget. Coordinators organise projects, procurement and office operations, senior managers lead programmes and departmental strategy, and analysts study processes to drive agile and lean improvements, often working with spreadsheets and business analysis. Construction firms, banks, government agencies and charities all need these skills.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D032", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
