    ('D157', 'start_here', 'Understand Tax Advisory, Transfer Pricing', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Tax advisory helps people and organisations understand and follow tax law. Tax advisors and compliance officers interpret legislation, inspect tax returns and study financial statements, while auditors, budget analysts and financial controllers check that accounts are accurate. Accounting firms, government revenue agencies and large companies employ most practitioners, and chartered qualifications are required to practise.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D157", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
