    ('D039', 'start_here', 'Understand Higher Education', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Higher education centres on teaching and leading colleges and universities, though the field also includes school-level teaching. Lecturers in subjects such as economics and medicine prepare lesson content, teach classes and assess students, while heads of institutions lead schools and faculties. Universities, colleges and other education institutions are the main employers.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D039", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
