    ('D040', 'start_here', 'Understand Vocational', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Vocational education means teaching practical, job-focused skills such as hospitality, food service and occupational driving. Teachers and assessors prepare lessons, demonstrate trades and assess learners, classroom assistants support pupils including those with special needs, and corporate trainers coach professionals at work. Technical colleges, schools, training centres and companies are common workplaces.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D040", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
