    ('D080', 'start_here', 'Understand Interior Design', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Interior design shapes how indoor spaces and visual scenes look and function. Interior designers and planners arrange rooms, furniture and lighting for homes and businesses, while related roles build and paint sets, design stage lighting, dress shop displays or create illustrations and animations. Design firms, theatres, studios and retail companies are the usual employers.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D080", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
