    ('D160', 'start_here', 'Understand Fashion Styling, Image Consulting', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Fashion styling and image consulting shape how people, products and brands look. Personal and fashion stylists put outfits together for clients, make-up artists and hair designers create complete looks, and visual merchandisers design shop displays and negotiate with suppliers. They work with fashion brands, retail stores, media productions and private clients.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D160", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
