    ('D048', 'start_here', 'Understand Food Science', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Food science covers how raw ingredients become safe, packaged food and drink. Machine operators run baking, blending and drinks production lines, bakers and meat cutters handcraft speciality foods, scientists research nutrition and microbiology, and supervisors apply hygiene and safety rules such as HACCP. Food and beverage factories, bakeries and dairies are the main workplaces.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D048", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
    ('D048', 'build_next', 'apply food-scientific knowledge safely', 'Build this next because the checked domain evidence names it as part of Food Science work and preparation.', 'Named domain-level Nigerian evidence (competency); it is a guidance starting point, not a universal checklist.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 2, '{"source": "nigerian_web_source_evidence", "domain_id": "D048", "evidence_kind": "competency", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
