    ('D048', 'build_next', 'Understand food processing', 'Build this after the orientation because strong CCMAS curriculum anchors show the concept is taught in programmes mapped to this domain.', 'CCMAS curriculum anchors: Agricultural Science::Fisheries and Aquaculture / Principles of Family and Consumer Sciences, Food Science and Technology; Agricultural Science::B.Sc./B.Tech Food Science and Technology / Principles of Food Processing and Preservation; Agricultural Science::B.Sc./B.Tech Food Science and Technology / Food Process Engineering; Agricultural Science::B.Sc./B.Tech Food Science and Technology / Unit Operations in Food Processing', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 6, '{"source": "ccmas_programme_domain_evidence", "domain_id": "D048", "anchor": "food processing", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
