    ('D051', 'start_here', 'Understand Real Estate', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Real estate is the business of land, buildings and property. Property managers look after buildings and tenants, brokers and investors arrange sales and purchases, and mortgage advisors and conveyancers handle finance, legal transfer and property financial analysis. Estate firms, banks and property companies are the typical workplaces.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D051", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
