    ('D058', 'start_here', 'Understand EdTech', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: EdTech joins teaching with digital tools to help people learn. Instructional designers and e-learning developers build online courses and learning experiences, ICT trainers and digital literacy teachers deliver lessons, and administrators keep learning management systems running. Schools, training providers and organisations that train their own staff employ these specialists.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D058", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
