    ('D081', 'start_here', 'Understand Office Administration, Secretarial', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Office administration keeps organisations running through everyday paperwork and communication. Secretaries, clerks and typists file documents, handle mail and correspondence, type letters, keep records and enter data into computer systems. Almost every type of employer needs them, from companies and schools to hospitals and government offices.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D081", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
