    ('D085', 'start_here', 'Understand Retail Sales, Shop Operations', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Retail sales is the selling of goods and services directly to customers. Cashiers operate tills, shop assistants help buyers find and understand products, specialised sellers advise on items such as vehicle parts, and rental and leasing agents arrange hire agreements. They work in shops, supermarkets, showrooms and call centres.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D085", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
