    ('D092', 'start_here', 'Understand Culinary Arts, Catering', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Culinary arts and catering is the preparation and serving of food and drink. Cooks and industrial cooks prepare meals, bartenders and sommeliers serve and recommend drinks, waiters and crew members attend to customers, and kitchen assistants support food preparation and hygiene. Restaurants, hotels, fast-food outlets and catering companies are the usual employers.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D092", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
