    ('D093', 'start_here', 'Understand Electrical Installation, Wiring', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Electrical installation is the fitting and repair of wiring and electrical equipment in buildings, vehicles and industry. Electricians read wiring plans, install cables and equipment, inspect electrical supplies and resolve faults in homes, factories and vehicles. They work for construction firms, electricity companies and maintenance contractors, and contracting work in Nigeria requires a statutory licence.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D093", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
