    ('D094', 'build_next', 'Understand electronics', 'Build this after the orientation because strong CCMAS curriculum anchors show the concept is taught in programmes mapped to this domain.', 'CCMAS curriculum anchors: Engineering::ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING / Applied Electricity II; Engineering::ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING / Measurements and Instrumentations; Engineering::ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING / Power Electronics; Engineering::ELECTRONIC ENGINEERING / Introduction to Electronic Design and 2 С 15 45 Practice', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 6, '{"source": "ccmas_programme_domain_evidence", "domain_id": "D094", "anchor": "electronics", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
