    ('D095', 'start_here', 'Understand Motor Vehicle Mechanics, Repairs', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Motor vehicle mechanics keep cars, trucks, motorcycles and even bicycles running. Mechanics and technicians service engines, repair vehicle electrical systems, restore and refurbish older vehicles and rebuild bodywork, while supervisors oversee maintenance workshops. Garages, vehicle workshops and transport companies provide most of the work.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D095", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
