    ('D096', 'start_here', 'Understand Agricultural', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Agricultural work combines farming with the machinery that makes it possible. Farmers grow crops and raise livestock, operators drive tractors and forestry equipment, and technicians repair and maintain agricultural machines, often on site in the field. Farms, plantations, forestry companies and equipment dealers are the main employers.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D096", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
