    ('D129', 'start_here', 'Understand Military, Defence', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Military and defence careers involve protecting the nation as part of the armed forces. Officers command army, navy and air force units, while corporals, engineers and specialists handle weaponry, drill, combat techniques, military engineering and intelligence work such as communications interception. Service is within the armed forces and defence establishments.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D129", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
