    ('D133', 'start_here', 'Understand Luxury', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Luxury craft and design covers the making and presentation of high-quality handmade goods. Craftspeople make jewellery, cut gems, engrave, sew bespoke clothing and restore antique furniture; designers create fashion, jewellery, furniture and perfumes; visual merchandisers and interior designers present the finished products. Workshops, fashion houses, design studios and upmarket shops provide the work.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D133", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
