    ('D168', 'start_here', 'Understand Esports & Creator Economy', 'Start here because the domain definition explains the field before a student chooses a specialised area or role.', 'Domain definition: Esports and the creator economy turn competitive gaming and online content into careers. Casters commentate on matches, coaches and analysts prepare teams, content creators build audiences and earn through sponsorships and subscriptions, and managers run events, teams and communities. Gaming organisations, media companies and marketing agencies offer most of the roles.', 'https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco', 1, '{"source": "domain_definition_library_and_domain_meta", "domain_id": "D168", "guidance_layer": "global_domain_foundation_v1", "ownership": "domain_owned"}'),
